  "data": {
    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Teams Event Companion",
    "summary": "Name one captain to get army lists filed by the deadline and scores reported after every round. Reserve each faction keyword to one player per team, including for allied units from a Codex. Allow exceptions where ally rules change the faction keyword or where multiple Codexes print a datasheet under different faction keywords. For instance, compare Chaos Daemons with the World Eaters Codex’s Khorne Daemons. Use the official app to muster. Once finished, each player picks an available Force Disposition card and logs it on their roster. The cap for each disposition is team size divided by 5, rounded up. For 5 players, give each a distinct disposition. For 8, cover all five dispositions first and allow the other 3 players to fill a second slot in a different disposition apiece.",
